A [_] arm without a lacuna: it collapses every unmapped value into one, and
must say so.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	kind: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	kind: int
}

forward: {
	kind: remap(input.kind, {
		"a": 1
		[_]: 0
	})
}
-- out/error --
the [_] arm collapses every unmapped value into one: declare what is lost with @lacuna(Type, "message"):
    1.0.thema:8:3
